Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:32:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/25] Refactor LLM continuation, UI rendering, and PDF export
 to fix duplication and symbol loss

- src/llm/llm_engine.py: Implement _glue_parts using difflib.SequenceMatcher to detect and trim overlapping text during auto-continuation, preventing duplicated sections in concatenated responses.
- src/ui/chat_view.py: Add clean_inline_math preprocessor to replace LaTeX inline blocks ($...$) with Unicode equivalents before passing to Flet, fixing missing symbols; introduce strict Markdown table parser generating native ft.DataTable components with sanitized cells.
